@inject Translator Translator

@{ UseReportCulture(); }

@* A padding page: printed so the booklet's page count reaches a whole number of sheets.

   It says in words that it is blank on purpose. An empty page reads as a printing fault, and the doubt
   is what makes someone flip back and forth looking for the pages they think they have lost.

   Shared by the duty booklets and the general instructions booklet, which pad by the same rule and
   whose padding pages are handed to the same people at the same meeting. *@

<p class="blank">@Translator("ThisPageIsIntentionalBlank")</p>
